      "en": "concerning zeal, persecuting the assembly; concerning the righteousness which is in the law, found blameless.",
      "ko": "열심으로는 교회를 핍박하고 율법의 의로는 흠이 없는 자로라",
      "source_text_hash": "ae936970cfc69b16899713d003238beb733365ebc090cf27d65a0df5834a3f75",
      "translation_text_hash": "9758b8ef8256da28b2829e2a78a4e9b863fcc0ceb797155a646d1963164bf180",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
